WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:04.626
The admin dashboard is the first page your team sees.

00:00:04.626 --> 00:00:07.085
Report widgets put a report on it:

00:00:07.085 --> 00:00:10.466
figures, tables and charts that follow the clock.

00:00:10.466 --> 00:00:15.690
This video shows the Report widget, the Custom Report widget for Report Builder

00:00:15.690 --> 00:00:18.210
reports, and what each person sees.

00:00:22.810 --> 00:00:26.703
Opening a report takes a menu, a date range and a click, and

00:00:26.703 --> 00:00:29.121
most days the question is the same:

00:00:29.121 --> 00:00:30.950
how did the last week go?

00:00:31.700 --> 00:00:34.652
A report widget answers it on the dashboard.

00:00:34.652 --> 00:00:38.963
You choose the report once, and a period that moves with the clock:

00:00:38.963 --> 00:00:42.210
the last 30 days is always the 30 days up to now.

00:00:42.960 --> 00:00:47.114
The widget keeps its result for a few minutes, so a busy dashboard

00:00:47.114 --> 00:00:49.711
does not run the report on every visit.

00:00:49.711 --> 00:00:51.500
And it checks the viewer:

00:00:51.500 --> 00:00:54.500
a report you may not open is not shown to you.

00:00:58.685 --> 00:01:01.496
Report widgets belong to the Admin Dashboard.

00:01:01.496 --> 00:01:05.023
Turn on the Admin Dashboard feature under Tools, Features.

00:01:05.023 --> 00:01:09.652
The Report widget comes with the Reports feature, and the Custom Report widget

00:01:09.652 --> 00:01:11.305
with the Report Builder.

00:01:13.056 --> 00:01:16.480
The Dashboard page is now the home of the admin.

00:01:16.480 --> 00:01:21.172
Manage Dashboard opens its editor, and Add Widget lists the widgets:

00:01:21.172 --> 00:01:24.596
Custom Report, Html Dashboard Widget and Report.

00:01:28.799 --> 00:01:31.115
Choose Add Widget, then Report.

00:01:31.115 --> 00:01:36.059
Position, Width and Height place the tile on the dashboard, and the Title

00:01:36.059 --> 00:01:37.749
is the name above it.

00:01:38.201 --> 00:01:42.673
Report lists every report you may view under Reports, by category.

00:01:42.673 --> 00:01:46.461
Here it is Queue service level, from Queue and Routing.

00:01:46.911 --> 00:01:50.560
Period is the stretch of time the widget covers:

00:01:50.560 --> 00:01:55.289
Today and Yesterday, the last 7, 30 or 90 days, this month, last

00:01:55.289 --> 00:02:00.424
month, this year, the last 12 months, All time, or Custom dates, which

00:02:00.424 --> 00:02:02.991
asks for a first and a last day.

00:02:03.442 --> 00:02:06.571
Show chooses what of the report appears:

00:02:06.571 --> 00:02:12.012
figures and tables, figures only, tables only, charts only, or everything.

00:02:12.482 --> 00:02:15.214
Rows per table limits a long table.

00:02:15.214 --> 00:02:19.744
Keep for sets how many minutes the widget keeps what it shows.

00:02:19.744 --> 00:02:22.542
Zero runs the report on every visit.

00:02:22.994 --> 00:02:24.286
Click Publish.

00:02:24.286 --> 00:02:27.128
The widget joins the dashboard editor.

00:02:27.128 --> 00:02:29.452
Add a second one the same way:

00:02:29.452 --> 00:02:33.004
Call insights, for the last 7 days, figures only.

00:02:37.181 --> 00:02:40.740
Close Editor, and the dashboard shows the tiles.

00:02:40.740 --> 00:02:44.761
Each one names its report and says the period in words.

00:02:45.248 --> 00:02:49.407
At the bottom, a tile says when its result was made, and Open

00:02:49.407 --> 00:02:54.248
the full report goes to the report itself, with every filter and export.

00:02:58.433 --> 00:03:02.722
The Custom Report widget shows a report built in the Report Builder.

00:03:02.722 --> 00:03:05.273
Choose Add Widget, then Custom Report.

00:03:07.019 --> 00:03:11.848
Report lists the published reports you may run under Reports, Report Builder, and

00:03:11.848 --> 00:03:14.679
the views you may use, which show as a table.

00:03:15.168 --> 00:03:20.192
The period replaces the first date filter that viewers can change on that

00:03:20.192 --> 00:03:23.690
report; a report without one shows its own dates.

00:03:23.690 --> 00:03:27.188
Show, Rows per table and Keep for work as before.

00:03:27.639 --> 00:03:32.149
Publish it, and the tile joins the dashboard beside the others.

00:03:36.361 --> 00:03:39.552
A widget never shows more than its viewer may open.

00:03:39.552 --> 00:03:43.750
This person has no permission for the Lead funnel report, so its tile

00:03:43.750 --> 00:03:46.941
says that they can't view it, and shows no numbers.

00:03:51.141 --> 00:03:53.325
A supervisor's start of day:

00:03:53.325 --> 00:03:58.271
queue service level and abandoned calls for yesterday, as figures only.

00:03:59.021 --> 00:04:00.683
A sales lead's board:

00:04:00.683 --> 00:04:06.101
lead funnel for this month, beside a Report Builder report of activities by agent.

00:04:06.851 --> 00:04:08.593
A quiet wall display:

00:04:08.593 --> 00:04:13.951
a longer cache time, so the dashboard stays fast however many people open it.

00:04:15.951 --> 00:04:20.587
Report widgets bring the numbers people check every day to the page they

00:04:20.587 --> 00:04:22.310
already open every day.

00:04:22.310 --> 00:04:25.995
Pick a report once, and its period moves with the clock.

00:04:25.995 --> 00:04:27.541
Thanks for watching.

